MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m01_001: I am not especially keen on enlisting the services of\na beast, but I note your ability. Will you hear me out?
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m01_002: <NCA>Ask about the details of Fabio's request.
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m01_003: <NCB>Inquire further regarding your ability.
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m01_004: <ACA>I am gladdened that you waste no time.\nI shall explain.
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m01_005: <ACB>You are a competitor in the main matches of the\nHeroic Games, are you not? That is proof enough.
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m01_006: I have become aware of a hidden underground\nfacility. Ruins, as you might term it.
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m01_007: I would like to investigate these ruins, but there is a\nconsiderable degree of risk to life and limb.
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m01_008: Dietrich is eager to depart, what with his penchant\nfor trouble.
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m01_009: I have learned the hard way, however, that it would\nbe good to assemble a larger force.
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m01_010: To that end I have been looking for expendable...er,\nexceptional individuals.
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m01_011: Your assistance in this endeavor is appreciated.\nInterested, I hope?
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m03_001: I will mark the location for you on the map.
MID_LGV_SCXX_01_m03_002: A reward will be prepared, naturally. I shall await\nyou there.